exports[`marketing price strings > the FAQ answers that name a price or a free tier 1`] = `
[
  {
    "answer": "GAIA is a paid product. Pro starts at $30 a month for full access with higher limits and priority support. Enterprise is available for teams that need SSO, custom integrations, and dedicated support. Self-hosting is free for non-commercial use under the PolyForm Noncommercial license; you pay only for your own server and model API usage.",
    "question": "Is GAIA free?",
  },
  {
    "answer": "GAIA Pro is the one hosted plan: email automation, calendar management, task organization, workflow automation, and integrations with the tools you already use, billed monthly or yearly. There is no free hosted plan; Enterprise adds what larger teams need.",
    "question": "What is included in GAIA Pro?",
  },
  {
    "answer": "GAIA Pro is $30/month, comparable to ChatGPT Plus ($20/month) and Motion ($19/month). Unlike these tools, GAIA can be self-hosted free for non-commercial use, and one plan combines capabilities that would otherwise require multiple subscriptions (email management, calendar AI, workflow automation, task management).",
    "question": "How does GAIA's pricing compare to competitors?",
  },
  {
    "answer": "Yes, for non-commercial use. GAIA is source-available under the PolyForm Noncommercial license, so personal and other non-commercial self-hosting costs nothing beyond your own server and model API usage. Running GAIA inside a business needs an enterprise license (contact the GAIA team). Our Docker-based setup makes deployment straightforward.",
    "question": "Can I self-host GAIA for free?",
  },
]
`;

